In the result, I pass the following :
ORDER (i) Both the appeals are allowed in part;
(ii) The appellant in MFA No.178/2019 is entitled for the compensation of Rs.51,000/- and the appellant in MFA No.215/2019 is entitled for the compensation of Rs.50,500/- together with interest at Rs.6% per annum on the enhanced amount.
- 11 - NC: 2024:KHC:20600 (iii) The entire amount shall be released in favour of the petitioner-appellant, upon proper verification;
(iv) Registry is directed to return the trial Court records to the Tribunal, along with certified copy of this order passed by this Court forthwith without any delay;
 (v) Draw award accordingly.
 Sd/-
